{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/f39cc2a1ea353156e821d66e6ecaa743.poster.avif?t=1761360854\" width=780 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/f39cc2a1ea353156e821d66e6ecaa743.webm?t=1761360854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/3b61794200a4ff00e2cc139de27cb8da.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're tasked with cleaning the local shrine in your hometown after the previous caretaker passed away. At first, it seems like a chore, but then you're greeted by the shrine's resident, a fox girl named Mao. She's hesitant to approach you, having been out of touch with humans for a very long time. However, she seems to appreciate your efforts in cleaning the shrine she calls home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intrigued by Mao, you\u2019re determined to get closer to her, and thirty days of cleaning the shrine feels like a small price to pay. Will you be able to win the fox girl\u2019s heart by the end of your task?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/2301768d8e65abeaa052d508f01bc0b4.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=79 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you're expected to clean the shrine, and in doing so, Mao warms up to you more and more. Gaining her trust will unlock new interactions, both with her and with your surroundings. You only have 30 days, so manage your time wisely between responsibilities and spending time with Mao. Raise her trust level to 100 before the time runs out to achieve the perfect ending with this cute fox girl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/5f0144215122a17cb60aad780abfe2f2.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/bb35f94d7d3dce48a3ed3df490021143.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=801 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/5b1e9fed239f8ad9a24cfe4f458884d3.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise Your Relationship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, you will have certain actions to choose from, that determine whether you build trust with Mao. How will your relationship evolve by the time you finish cleaning the shrine? Will you choose to stay or move on?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of actions you can take each day is limited, and each action determines what values increase, if any. Choose your actions wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Saved Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save your progress at any time in case you want to revisit certain options before reaching the end of your shrine-cleaning task. Who knows, maybe you\u2019ll regret taking that nap instead of fluffing her tail?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Community Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845600/ef1834fd0f5347e66f6235ce1b084423bd36109a.jpg"},{"name":"New Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845600/b14c4ab10c7093899a2f3fca6f415aa5342844a2.jpg"},{"name":"Soft Privilege","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845600/639a063c748af11d7db728cdbeb91a788404b5b0.jpg"},{"name":"Spiritually Sanitized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845600/2afdfb1c7a5521e34f8941d2cccf9ab8b8dedc39.jpg"},{"name":"Sudden Pressure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845600/a93cc2c3491666ac1b7a29b81d5bfdb112b06359.jpg"},{"name":"Feline Visitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845600/1659f73a8188072bb1a49628ffbc454cb839badc.jpg"},{"name":"Full of Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845600/09069712aa3ba1961ae1f1e805cc60acefdb0bf2.jpg"},{"name":"Boundless Trust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845600/9a89425908590d56818f23b934c0cf27c74bcbb4.jpg"},{"name":"Sanctuary Restored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845600/af6b5a1ea1d8ab08ca5443709884cbd694604fce.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845600?t=1761360854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/72a3f9c89852628fc9af082bc564c366ed1f06f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761360854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/ce264a6e52da74d7542e77b1392d8876fee9a839/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761360854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/ce264a6e52da74d7542e77b1392d8876fee9a839/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761360854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4003600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/f39cc2a1ea353156e821d66e6ecaa743.poster.avif?t=1761360854\" width=780 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/f39cc2a1ea353156e821d66e6ecaa743.webm?t=1761360854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/3b61794200a4ff00e2cc139de27cb8da.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're tasked with cleaning the local shrine in your hometown after the previous caretaker passed away. At first, it seems like a chore, but then you're greeted by the shrine's resident, a fox girl named Mao. She's hesitant to approach you, having been out of touch with humans for a very long time. However, she seems to appreciate your efforts in cleaning the shrine she calls home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intrigued by Mao, you\u2019re determined to get closer to her, and thirty days of cleaning the shrine feels like a small price to pay. Will you be able to win the fox girl\u2019s heart by the end of your task?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/2301768d8e65abeaa052d508f01bc0b4.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=79 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you're expected to clean the shrine, and in doing so, Mao warms up to you more and more. Gaining her trust will unlock new interactions, both with her and with your surroundings. You only have 30 days, so manage your time wisely between responsibilities and spending time with Mao. Raise her trust level to 100 before the time runs out to achieve the perfect ending with this cute fox girl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/5f0144215122a17cb60aad780abfe2f2.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/bb35f94d7d3dce48a3ed3df490021143.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=801 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/extras/5b1e9fed239f8ad9a24cfe4f458884d3.avif?t=1761360854\" width=616 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise Your Relationship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, you will have certain actions to choose from, that determine whether you build trust with Mao. How will your relationship evolve by the time you finish cleaning the shrine? Will you choose to stay or move on?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of actions you can take each day is limited, and each action determines what values increase, if any. Choose your actions wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Saved Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save your progress at any time in case you want to revisit certain options before reaching the end of your shrine-cleaning task. Who knows, maybe you\u2019ll regret taking that nap instead of fluffing her tail?</p>","developers":["Flash Club"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845600/33629f11c7401599813727f0b29a0ee3bd3b0f5f/header.jpg?t=1761360854","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Saikey Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845600/496301742/3b7cc7e5eb39fac521f923e587c3af4516352fe4/1757246433/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760030028","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845600/496301742/3b7cc7e5eb39fac521f923e587c3af4516352fe4/1757246433/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760030028","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845600/496301742/3b7cc7e5eb39fac521f923e587c3af4516352fe4/1757246433/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760030028","id":257194189,"name":"EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194189/d0ef09b1741bceb94edb715a7a1bff0ecc5c0a31/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760030028"}],"name":"Living with a Little Fox Girl","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Living with a Little Fox Girl - $5.99 USD","packageid":1352230,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":599}],"title":"Buy Living with a Little Fox Girl"}],"packages":[1352230],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows\u00ae 7/8/8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direc